🎨 FREE ComfyUI Workflow | Z Image Turbo + Face Detailer (AI Portrait Generation on RunPod)

In this video I'm sharing my free ComfyUI workflow that combines Z Image Turbo with an advanced Face Detailer pipeline — producing stunning, high-fidelity AI portraits with sharp, detailed faces straight out of the box.
This workflow uses the z_image_turbo_bf16 UNET model paired with Qwen 3 4B CLIP, a custom LoRA, and a full FaceDetailer pass powered by YOLOv8 face detection, SAM (Segment Anything Model), and the ComfyUI Impact Pack — all running in a single clean workflow at 1600×1600 resolution.

🔧 WHAT'S IN THE WORKFLOW:

Z Image Turbo (bf16) UNET + AE VAE
Qwen 3 4B CLIP text encoder
KSampler with Euler / Beta57 scheduler
LoRA Loader Stack (rgthree) for both base gen & face detailer pass
FaceDetailer node with YOLOv8m bbox detector + SAM model
Before/after image comparison node built in
Optimized positive & negative prompt templates included


